000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. AIXNATL.
000300* Load the base cluster of a KSDS that carries two alternate keys:
000400* DEPT, with duplicates, and CODE, unique. The alternate indexes are
000500* built by BLDINDEX after the load -- VSAM does not maintain them
000600* while the base is being created.
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000900 FILE-CONTROL.
001000     SELECT AIX-FILE ASSIGN TO AIXBAS
001100         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001200         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001300         RECORD KEY IS AIX-KEY
001400         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS AIX-DEPT WITH DUPLICATES
001500         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS AIX-CODE
001600         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001700 DATA DIVISION.
001800 FILE SECTION.
001900 FD  AIX-FILE
002000     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002100     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002200 01  AIX-RECORD.
002300     02  AIX-KEY                 PIC X(5).
002400     02  FILLER                  PIC X(5).
002500     02  AIX-DEPT                PIC X(3).
002600     02  AIX-CODE                PIC X(4).
002700     02  AIX-TEXT                PIC X(63).
002800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002900 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC XX VALUE '00'.
003000 01  WS-IDX                      PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
003100 01  WS-IMAGES.
003200     05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE 'K0001     BBBC300  '.
003300     05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE 'K0002     AAAC100  '.
003400     05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE 'K0003     CCCC500  '.
003500     05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE 'K0004     AAAC400  '.
003600     05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE 'K0005     BBBC200  '.
003700     05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE 'K0006     AAAC600  '.
003800 01  WS-TABLE REDEFINES WS-IMAGES.
003900     05  WS-IMAGE PIC X(20) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
004000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
004100 MAIN-PARA.
004200     OPEN OUTPUT AIX-FILE.
004300     DISPLAY 'OPEN OUTPUT ' WS-STATUS.
004400     PERFORM WRITE-ONE VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1
004500         UNTIL WS-IDX > 6.
004600     CLOSE AIX-FILE.
004700     DISPLAY 'CLOSE ' WS-STATUS.
004800     STOP RUN.
004900 WRITE-ONE.
005000     MOVE SPACES TO AIX-RECORD.
005100     MOVE WS-IMAGE (WS-IDX) TO AIX-RECORD.
005200     MOVE 'record text' TO AIX-TEXT.
005300     WRITE AIX-RECORD.
005400     DISPLAY 'WRITE ' AIX-KEY ' ' WS-STATUS.
